title: "Tarak Dhaouadi for Sample Size"
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
authors:
  - family-names: Dhaouadi
    given-names: Tarak
repository-code: "https://github.com/tarak-dhaouadi/sample-size-calculator"
url: "https://github.com/tarak-dhaouadi/sample-size-calculator"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A free, dependency-free Java desktop application for sample-size calculation
  in common biomedical and epidemiological designs: proportions, means,
  correlations, survival (hazard ratio, log-rank), ANOVA, linear regression
  and diagnostic accuracy, with sample-size and power plots for every design.
keywords:
  - sample size
  - power analysis
  - biostatistics
  - epidemiology
  - Java
